#
# **Sample check:** 29 badges, side 3, capacity 6 → display 9, full bags 3, loose badges 2. A second case is 34 badges, side 2, capacity 4 → display 4, full bags 7, loose badges 2. Predict the second case before changing the starting values and running.
#
# Assume enough badges for the display and positive whole-number counts. Explain why / answers a different question from full bags.
#
